75
00:14:57,216 --> 00:15:01,216
Did you guys know that a fish called kudu-kudu existed?

76
00:15:01,216 --> 00:15:02,216
This is Kudu-Kudu Telur Asin...

77
00:15:03,224 --> 00:15:04,524
Mmm, ini...
Mmm, this is...

78
00:15:04,524 --> 00:15:08,324
So Indonesia really has such a rich cultured cuisine.

79
00:15:08,324 --> 00:15:10,624
I've never eaten this before.

80
00:15:10,624 --> 00:15:14,624
This is one of Jala Rasa's specialties.

81
00:15:14,624 --> 00:15:17,524
