This boxfish is served with a very popular telor asin sauce.
This boxfish is served with a very popular salted egg sauce.

84
00:15:28,724 --> 00:15:31,324
The texture is membal-membal, you know?
The texture is springy, you know?

85
00:15:31,324 --> 00:15:33,424
Enak banget.
It's so delicious.

86
00:15:33,424 --> 00:15:37,024
I would recommend you guys eat this.

