90
00:15:52,324 --> 00:15:56,524
Okay, so this is Iga Sapi Bakar Cabe Ijo.
Okay, so this is grilled beef ribs with green chili.

91
00:15:56,524 --> 00:16:00,024
It's a Javanese specialty...

92
00:16:00,024 --> 00:16:05,324
...smoked ribs served with sambal ijo, a.k.a. green chili.
...grilled ribs served with green chili sambal.

93
00:16:05,324 --> 00:16:11,724
So unlike the previous sambal we had, this one is made of only green chilis and other aromatics.

94
00:16:11,724 --> 00:16:14,424
So, the iga itself is sweet,
So, the ribs themselves are sweet,

95
00:16:14,424 --> 00:16:18,324
so combined with this spicy and a little bit savory sambal ijo condiment,
so combined with this spicy and a little bit savory green chili condiment,

96
00:16:18,324 --> 00:16:22,024
