97
00:16:23,724 --> 00:16:25,524
Ini dagingnya empuk juga.
This meat is also tender.

98
00:16:25,524 --> 00:16:28,324
The meat is so soft, I recommend this one.

99
00:16:29,724 --> 00:16:32,124
