100
00:16:32,124 --> 00:16:34,224
You know what it is.

101
00:16:34,224 --> 00:16:36,424
It's the beloved Nasi Goreng!
It's the beloved fried rice!

102
00:16:36,424 --> 00:16:42,024
So we have this traditional chicken Nasi Goreng that's cooked with terasi, yeah guys.
So we have this traditional chicken fried rice that's cooked with shrimp paste, yeah guys.

103
00:16:42,024 --> 00:16:45,724
Terasi is a local shrimp or krill paste.

104
00:16:45,724 --> 00:16:47,424
