105
00:16:47,424 --> 00:16:53,124
I think it's known as belacan in Malaysia and also kapi in Thailand, yeah.

106
00:16:53,124 --> 00:16:55,224
Let's try this.

107
00:16:58,524 --> 00:17:00,624
It's a mix of...

108
00:17:00,624 --> 00:17:06,024
...sweet and spicy and savory.
...sweet, spicy, and savory.

109
00:17:06,024 --> 00:17:11,024
And as usual when you're eating Nasi Goreng, don't forget the kerupuk!
And as usual when you're eating fried rice, don't forget the crackers!

110
00:17:12,024 --> 00:17:14,224
This is Nasi Liwet.

111
00:17:14,224 --> 00:17:18,724
Nasi Liwet is a Sundanese specialty rice that is topped with...

112
