123
00:18:08,624 --> 00:18:12,524
The history of Coto Makassar dates back to the 16th century...

124
00:18:12,524 --> 00:18:15,524
...during the era of the Gowa Kingdom.

125
00:18:15,524 --> 00:18:18,524
Coto was a special dish that symbolized wealth and luxury,

126
00:18:18,524 --> 00:18:22,624
