127
00:18:22,624 --> 00:18:23,824
Like me!

128
00:18:23,824 --> 00:18:25,224
Let's give it a taste.

129
00:18:28,024 --> 00:18:29,224
Yummy.

130
00:18:29,224 --> 00:18:33,224
Clove itu itu loh guys, cengkeh, cengkeh.
Cloves are those, guys, cloves, cloves.

131
00:18:34,724 --> 00:18:38,224
So fresh, megar-megar!
So fresh, so satisfying!

132
00:18:38,224 --> 00:18:43,224
Now that we've finished eating all the savory food,

133
00:18:43,224 --> 00:18:45,324
