00:22:16,732 --> 00:22:21,732
...five squats!

190
00:22:21,732 --> 00:22:23,732
Five squats? I did five squats yesterday!

191
00:22:23,732 --> 00:22:26,732
No, no, no, listen. The good thing is that there is no punishment game...

192
00:22:26,732 --> 00:22:32,732
