195
00:22:41,432 --> 00:22:47,432
And then... After five squats? Yeah, my legs will be tired.

196
00:22:47,432 --> 00:22:54,232
You can finish it with your hands, yeah. And then when you're done, just be like, 'Hey, I'm done!' And then you run here.

197
00:22:54,232 --> 00:22:59,732
And then... you just shake your butt ten times. I'll be watching!

198
00:22:59,732 --> 00:23:03,232
Yeah, ten. Or you want twenty? No, no, no, ten is good! Ten is perfect!

199
00:23:03,232 --> 00:23:07,732
Twenty just for more clarify? No, no, ten is perfect. Alright, good to know.

200
00:23:07,732 --> 00:23:12,232
Alright, so like you do ten, and then once we count and give the okay, you run back.

201
00:23:12,232 --> 00:23:16,732
And then straight to the back, you know, the finish line, and then, yeah, the fastest one wins.

202
00:23:16,732 --> 00:23:19,732
Oh, okay! Okay!

203
00:23:23,732 --> 00:23:28,232
Is this an Indonesian game? Yeah, pretty much.

204
00:23:28,232 --> 00:23:32,232
It's a kerupuk eating contest. But I don't think you shake your butt. You don't shake your butt?

205
00:23:32,232 --> 00:23:37,232
